    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math intriguing, especially in chemistry and its applications. I enjoy the logical structure, even if it doesn’t always align with my artistic inclinations. It’s a tool, not a passion, and I appreciate how it helps solve real-world problems.",
